sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Host as MCP Host
    participant MCP as GemArc MCP
    participant Core as Model Core
    participant Assets as Registry
    participant QA as Validator
    User->>Host: 制作多媒体文档
    Host->>MCP: guide()（多媒体文档制作流程，服务器随包发布）
    MCP-->>Host: 逐步工作流（硬规则 + 工具顺序）
    Host->>MCP: inspect(sources)
    MCP->>Core: extractEvidence()
    Core-->>MCP: facts + unknowns
    Host->>MCP: model(plan)
    MCP->>Core: validateReferences()
    Host->>MCP: assets(query)
    MCP->>Assets: resolveAndLock()
    Assets-->>MCP: componentLock
    Host->>MCP: build(modelRef, output)
    MCP->>QA: validateModel + verifyBuild
    alt 验证失败
      QA-->>MCP: errors
      MCP-->>Host: failed + diagnostics
    else 验证通过
      QA-->>MCP: pass
      Host->>MCP: export(buildId)
      MCP-->>Host: artifactRefs + checksum
    end
